1
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,438
That's not what
you said yesterday.

2
00:00:05,438 --> 00:00:07,140
I thought there was
nothing between us.

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,241
I'm sorry.

4
00:00:08,241 --> 00:00:09,709
Have you ever dated
a guy before?

5
00:00:09,876 --> 00:00:10,677
- What?
- Have you ever

6
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:12,145
had feelings for a guy
before this?

7
00:00:12,645 --> 00:00:13,346
No.

8
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:15,682
You weren't confused about
your feelings then.

9
00:00:15,982 --> 00:00:17,484
Then it's more likely that

10
00:00:17,484 --> 00:00:19,324
you're just confused
by a whole new experience.

11
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,055
See?

12
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:23,655
You can't say anything
because I'm right.

13
00:00:26,593 --> 00:00:27,627
Wait.

14
00:00:28,495 --> 00:00:29,596
Please, wait!

15
00:00:31,831 --> 00:00:33,400
I'm really sorry.

16
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,935
I know it will sound
like an excuse

17
00:00:36,102 --> 00:00:38,471
I just needed a bit of time
to accept how I feel.

18
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:41,408
I won't ask you to
accept me.

19
00:00:41,408 --> 00:00:42,408
I just...

20
00:00:44,911 --> 00:00:46,546
I wanted you to know
how I feel.

21
00:00:46,946 --> 00:00:47,946
Okay?

22
00:00:51,818 --> 00:00:52,818
Eun-ho.

23
00:01:14,641 --> 00:01:15,642
I'm sorry.

24
00:01:16,342 --> 00:01:18,244
I just wanted to
get back at you.

25
00:01:19,746 --> 00:01:20,746
I love you, too.
